      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated feline-focused veterinary staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Cat owners overwhelmingly praise Dr. Gandy and her support staff, including Liz and Grace, for their warmth, expertise, and patient bedside manner. Reviewers note that the team explains medical conditions clearly and avoids recommending unnecessary procedures or expenses. Clients appreciate the welcoming environment and feel their cats are in capable hands."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Low-stress handling for feline patients"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight how gentle and comforting the staff is with timid, nervous, or feisty cats. Pet parents emphasize that the quiet, cat-only environment without barking dogs keeps pets much calmer during exams, blood draws, and surgical recovery. Owners note that even anxious cats experience stress-free veterinary visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Accurate diagnoses and surgical treatments"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers report excellent clinical outcomes for urgent surgeries, oncology management, dental assessments, and chronic conditions like hyperthyroidism. Clients appreciate practical and honest medical advice, noting that targeted treatments and lifestyle recommendations resolved long-standing health and behavioral issues in their cats."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Lonestar Feline Health Center treat dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "No, the hospital specializes exclusively in feline care, providing a quiet, dog-free clinic environment for cats."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What surgical procedures does Dr. Gandy perform?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The clinic performs feline soft-tissue surgeries, tumor removals, foreign-body extractions, and dental procedures."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How do clients transport and comfort anxious cats for visits?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The clinic provides pre-visit guidance and uses gentle handling techniques to keep cats calm during appointments."
      },
